@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Respondent" as Respondent
actor "External Report Service" as ReportSvc
actor "External Post-Survey-Action Service" as PsaSvc
actor "System Operator" as Operator
actor "Admin Module" as AdminApp
actor "Authoring Module" as AuthorApp

rectangle "Elicit Survey" {
  usecase "UC-001\nEnter Survey via Access Code" as UC001
  usecase "UC-002\nAnswer Survey Questions" as UC002
  usecase "UC-003\nReview Answers" as UC003
  usecase "UC-004\nFinalize Survey" as UC004
  usecase "UC-005\nView Reports & Download PDF" as UC005
  usecase "UC-006\nLog Out" as UC006
  usecase "UC-007\nLog Startup Diagnostics" as UC007
  usecase "UC-008\nRebuild Reporting Schema" as UC008
  usecase "UC-009\nComplete the Survey in My Language" as UC009
  usecase "UC-010\nRename Reporting Schema" as UC010
  usecase "UC-011\nDrop Reporting Schema" as UC011
  usecase "UC-012\nRecord Respondent Progress" as UC012
  usecase "UC-013\nHold Report Marks" as UC013
  usecase "UC-014\nRender the Respondent Report" as UC014
}

Respondent --> UC001
Respondent --> UC002
Respondent --> UC003
Respondent --> UC004
Respondent --> UC005
Respondent --> UC006
Operator --> UC007 : reads the log
AdminApp --> UC008 : POST /api/etl/build?survey=<key>\nafter applying a survey definition
AdminApp --> UC010 : POST /api/etl/schema/<key>/rename
AuthorApp --> UC011 : DELETE /api/etl/schema/<key>\nbefore deleting the survey
Respondent --> UC009
AdminApp --> UC012 : reads presented_dt, last_activity_dt\nand saved_dt for its participation report
AdminApp --> UC013 : installs report_items\nwith the survey definition
AuthorApp --> UC013 : mints the marks and exports\nthem in the .elicit file
AdminApp --> UC014 : POST /api/reports/respondent-summary\nwhen printing a respondent's reports

UC005 ..> UC014 : <<include>>\n(a report whose address is a path\nis the built-in report, called in process)
UC014 ..> UC013 : <<include>>\n(reads the RESPONDENT marks)
UC004 ..> UC005 : <<include>>\n(navigates to report view, which sends\nthe respondent straight to the post-survey\nURL when the survey lists no reports)
UC009 ..> UC001 : <<extend>>\n(language applies to every page)
UC002 ..> UC002 : <<extend>>\n(branching shows/hides/repeats\ndownstream questions)
UC001 ..> UC012 : <<include>>\n(the first page render stamps\nthe rows it shows)
UC002 ..> UC012 : <<include>>\n(every page render and save\nstamps rows and the respondent)

UC004 --> PsaSvc : notifies (webhook POST)
UC005 --> ReportSvc : requests report data
UC007 --> ReportSvc : probes reachability (GET)
UC007 --> PsaSvc : probes reachability (GET)

@enduml
